</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>A heart resigned, submissive, meek,</l><l>My dear Redeemer’s throne;</l><l>Where only Christ is heard to speak,</l><l>Where Jesus reigns alone.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>A humble, lowly, contrite heart,</l><l>Believing, true, and clean,</l><l>Which neither death nor life can part</l><l>From Him that dwells within.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>A heart in every thought renewed,</l><l>And filled with love divine;</l><l>Perfect and right, and pure and good,</l><l>A copy, Lord, of Thine.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Thy nature, gracious Lord, impart,</l><l>Come quickly from above;</l><l>Write Thy new name upon my heart,</l><l>Thy new, best name of Love.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
